{"width": 1170, "height": 2080, "path": "kria-cigdem-test/upload/T2/IMG_7128.PNG", "boxes": [[0.07751938053965123, 0.020348836871070697, 0.1524547784784366, 0.039244186006836324, "9:41"], [0.3617571037018726, 0.07403846121156565, 0.6382428924221584, 0.09302325582826487, "• streetnotes.co"], [0.023255814179852112, 0.1279069763216063, 0.05943152409175282, 0.15406976757374258, "<"], [0.3152454764030041, 0.12645348801558098, 0.6899224856594811, 0.15261627926771715, "STREETNOTES"], [0.02842376613047543, 0.1889423080568623, 0.8914728738695246, 0.23557692344147763, "Kervan celebrates 10 years"], [0.03359173785939931, 0.2311046517251112, 0.7183462513309538, 0.2659883709493074, "with a sunrise show at"], [0.03297418631158042, 0.26962964186396965, 0.39855035818658047, 0.30885873042715506, "Pamukkale"], [0.030764292652319995, 0.3211659644247735, 0.8065024007085433, 0.34697304432683573, "The Istanbul streetwear label teamed up with Lumo:"], [0.0335917299631736, 0.3473837211908398, 0.8036175733959995, 0.3692307693634238, "patterns drawn on Lumo tablets, the show filmed on"], [0.0331887009002098, 0.3659626166180725, 0.48883502668813716, 0.390601318937291, "drone-mounted Lumo phones."], [0.033591733103352915, 0.7441860465242552, 0.8010335984211948, 0.7601744184466749, "Istanbul-based streetwear label Kervan marked its 10th"], [0.03359173858789572, 0.7644230766904044, 0.8785529473552567, 0.7850961536134814, "anniversary with a sunrise runway show staged on the iconic"], [0.03359172090767154, 0.7863372090803729, 0.9612403336881201, 0.8052884618709706, "travertine terraces of Pamukkale. The presentation brought together"], [0.03359172316988589, 0.8081395352791385, 0.904392765253887, 0.8284883721045827, "seasonal shapes, earth tones and graphic patterns against the"], [0.033591739197677425, 0.8283653849779173, 0.7054263620943121, 0.8490384619009942, "site's pale mineral pools and layered formations."], [0.03617573105949377, 0.8619186050465801, 0.9173126334366304, 0.8822674418720243, "For the collection, Kervan worked with Lumo on patterns drawn"], [0.03359174033014855, 0.8836538464746818, 0.8863048834424616, 0.9026162792626503, "directly on Lumo tablets, while drone-mounted Lumo phones"], [0.03359173087943315, 0.9038461536750352, 0.9534883571481299, 0.9230769229058043, "captured the runway from above. The result is a fashion story that"], [0.03617570659764381, 0.9258720929466521, 0.9354005079464685, 0.9447674420824178, "moves between streetwear energy, natural scenery and editorial"], [0.03340939014743855, 0.9471474347299506, 0.20173273093019095, 0.9670967517084051, "technology."]]}
